{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpejf7ipfAFGMb8XKSaD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9105\n\n## Analysis\n\nFollowing the decision procedure:\n\n### 1. The request\n- **Request ID:** DR-9105\n- **Customer (CRM):** CRM-2091, Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n- **Product (SKU):** NS-500\n- **Requested discount:** 15%\n- **Request date:** 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor:** Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- **Basis:** Contract pricing (cites Acme Master Supply Agreement)\n\n### 2. Customer identification\nThe system shows a **critical customer mismatch**:\n\n- **Request is for:** CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co.), DUNS **09-552-1187**, ERP customer C-1044\n- **Cited contract (ACME-MFG-2025) covers:** CRM-2048 (Acme Mfg. Holdings), DUNS **04-812-7730**, ERP customer C-1001\n\nThe DUNS numbers are different, indicating these are different legal entities. The contract cited in the justification does not cover the customer on the request.\n\n### 3. Product\nNS-500 confirmed: list price $250,000, active in product catalog.\n\n### 4. Active contract\nNo registered contract covers CRM-2091. The only Acme-related agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) covers a different customer (CRM-2048, different DUNS).\n\n### 5. Pricing exception\nEXC-ACME-NS500-15 (the 15% exception cited) applies to CRM-2048 (DUNS 04-812-7730), not CRM-2091.\n\n### 6. Policy in effect\nPRICING-POLICY-2026 (request date 2026-09-23 is in 2026):\n- Enterprise Account Executives: up to 10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n- Discounts >10% require recorded approval evidence\n\n### 7. Requestor authority\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. Under the 2026 policy, her authority is limited to 10%. A 15% discount exceeds her authority and would require VP Sales approval (Michael Torres).\n\n**However:** This is secondary to the customer identification issue.\n\n### 8. Required approver\nIf commercial eligibility were established, VP Sales (Michael Torres) would be required.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe request relies on a contract term (Acme Master Supply Agreement) to establish eligibility, but the registered agreement covering that name applies to a different customer (different DUNS number). No evidence establishes that any registered agreement or pricing exception covers CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9105\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co., DUNS 09-552-1187)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Request cites 'Acme Master Supply Agreement' but registered ACME-MFG-2025 covers customer CRM-2048 (DUNS 04-812-7730), not the request's customer CRM-2091 (DUNS 09-552-1187)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10% (Enterprise Account Executive authority)\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example, EMP-200)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 registered and in effect on request date\",\n    \"Sarah Chen confirmed as Enterprise Account Executive (EMP-101)\",\n    \"NS-500 confirmed in product catalog at $250,000 list price\",\n    \"Request recorded in Northstar CRM as DR-9105\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Customer agreement for CRM-2091 (Acme Industrial Supply Co., DUNS 09-552-1187). The agreement cited as the basis (ACME-MFG-2025) is registered for customer CRM-2048 (Acme Mfg. Holdings, DUNS 04-812-7730) — a different legal entity.\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide the customer agreement or pricing exception that establishes eligibility for CRM-2091, or confirm whether the request should reference customer CRM-2048 instead\",\n      \"who\": \"Sales leadership or Deal Desk\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5930,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5930},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49741661-df44-4372-9838-fe3be409bb2b","uuid":"88b9b984-57fd-4e01-afbd-98ebcd4ae823","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:59:02.564Z","request_id":"req_011CfpejeqrXUQvih4dwZTce"}
